n performa","Quality review/revisi dan performa creator terpisah; header tidak memberi kontrak threshold penilaian.",null],["WB10","Payout per talent","Tanggal atau Diajukan tidak otomatis membuktikan penerimaan kas. Perlu status, paid_at, nominal dan evidence terpisah.",null],["WB11","Insight snapshot","LIKE+COMMENT+SHARE+SAVE+REPOST dibagi VIEWS ×100. Ini ER views, bukan followers.",null],["WB12","Referensi progress/rekapan","Label Sheet Data Progress/File Rekapan bukan bukti isi workbook eksternal telah dibaca.",null],[null,null,null,null],["Sumber: dua workbook di 4. Refrence; detail sheet/range di architecture/workbook_reference_2026_10_18.md dan structure_profile.json.",null,null,null]]}
